cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below. A preferred article citation will be added once the manuscript is published."
type: software
title: "PhyloDater: A multi-software parallel platform for phylogenetic molecular dating"
abstract: "PhyloDater is a unified phylogenetic dating platform that integrates multiple mainstream dating software, providing consistent interfaces and standardized result outputs."
authors:
