keywords:
  - phylogenetics
  - molecular-dating
  - evolution
  - bioinformatics
  - phylogeny
  - divergence-time
  - molecular-clock
# No `preferred-citation` is emitted on purpose: there is no published article
# and no registered DOI for this project yet, and a placeholder DOI
# (`10.XXXX/XXXX`) in a machine-readable citation file is read by GitHub,
# Zenodo and Zotero as if it were real. Once the companion article exists,
# register the Zenodo DOI, write it into README.md and this file, then add
# `preferred-citation` with the real journal/volume/pages/DOI.
